<section id="about" class="relative bg-ink py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
          The Concept
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-tight text-paper sm:text-5xl">
          We provide the tools.{' '}
          <span class="text-gold">You decide how to use them.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          Fortitude Endeavours exists to build wealth for you and your family,
          not through guesswork, but through a solid strategy with clear, measurable
          goals. Our role is simple: give you access to the tools that create
          long-term financial freedom, and let you choose how to deploy them
          according to your own appetite for risk.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
          That choice currently comes down to two paths: active forex and commodity
          trading, managed by traders with significant experience running large
          funds, or property development, a slower, asset-backed route that
          typically carries lower risk and, in turn, lower expected returns. Both
          are built on the same foundation of transparency and disciplined
          strategy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80"
            alt="Financial strategist reviewing market data and charts"
            class="h-[480px] w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 hidden max-w-xs rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-panel p-6 shadow-xl sm:block">
          <p class="font-display text-lg text-gold">Clear goals.</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ash">
            Every strategy starts with a defined objective and a risk profile that
            matches it. Nothing is one-size-fits-all.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
